        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Achun sina bam jing lakge,",
            "Kandih pihru jao rian tatna;",
            "Kabam kathui jingmei %&6na,",
            "Achang ding kham he poubaumei.",
            "",
            "Chorus:",
            "Ata nduang lou o,",
            "Lunggeimei muang jingmei khou%&6;",
            "Adang khou bammo poubaumei,",
            "Kap bammei nthak khang.",
            "",
            "2. Guang nimei ramta ai machun,",
            "Banchra nthanmei lungpui ram;",
            "Lung rianra na ai kap bamme,",
            "Lung rianramei muang dingkhou hei.",
            "",
            "3. He abumang kap bammei hei,",
            "Kandih khou hei nthak kei the;",
            "Ngum jaina kumma sam nithe,",
            "Ringsuangmei bam tingkauh ramkhou.",
            "",
            "4. Khou tei rianramei kap bammei,",
            "Makge kanan ramgai khou tei;",
            "Kanloumei pu nduang lou o,",
            "Theimei duipang ram khou hei."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
